        This spectrum plots how strongly 1,3-butadiene absorbs ultraviolet light across different wavelengths.
    </p>
    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;">
        <button onclick="prevStep()" style="padding: 3px 8px;">◀</button>
        <strong id="stepLabel" style="font-size: 11px; color: #555;">1 / 4</strong>
        <button onclick="nextStep()" style="padding: 3px 8px;">▶</button>
